====== ASUS RT-N18U ======

The ASUS RT-N18U was released in 2014. It has 5 gigabit ethernet ports and does 802.11n (2.4GHz-only) @ 450Mbps, when using TurboQAM™ 600Mbps. It is based on the Broadcom [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.broadcom.bcm53xx|BCM53xx]] SoC platform. **WiFi does not work**.

